  "title": "Rice Flour Mexican Chocolate Cupcakes (Gluten Free)",
  "description": "In these rice flour cupcakes, cinnamon, cayenne, and Mexican chocolate are mixed with rice flour for an extra spicy kick. Serve at your next party!",
